      "line": 111,
      "obj_id": "docs/bsp/CREATOR-00-CONCEPTS.md#0.1.0-rationale",
      "text": "The actual IOC carries HSE intent in the virtual source key, while the primary-only parser yields a nullable value and generated HSI fallback. Silent priority on conflicting keys, accepting arbitrary tokens, and importing the board's 25 MHz runtime assumption were considered and rejected: they would hide disagreement or fabricate input intent. The existing accepted clock-owner correction remains unchanged. The scope ratifies only this narrow contract, not legacy Creator/BSP narratives, register encodings, reserved frequency overrides, other phases or hardware. ERRATA-001 remains diagnosed until a resolving commit and actual verification are recorded."
    }
